    - rid: 6774952781063389263
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Oh, I''m so glad to hear!

          You know... our chef,
          Andrey, hasn''t been feeling the best lately, and those news would <b>really</b>
          cheer him up.

          Would you mind telling him?'
